Chapter: DigitOverflowMagicTest
  cites Codexmagic chapter ServerUtil (parse-int-loop)
  cites Foreword chapter Console

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("codexmagic 42 " & show (parse-int-loop "42" 0 0) & " 20 digits " & show (parse-int-loop "99999999999999999999" 0 0))
  end
